{"articleNo":"3043","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3043&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2012학년도 1학기 국가장학금 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.12.05","hit":"19097","attachments":[{"name":"차상위계층+증빙서류.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3043&attachNo=1657"},{"name":"국가장학금+안내(홈페이지용)2차.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3043&attachNo=2141"},{"name":"국가장학금+신청+매뉴얼(2차).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3043&attachNo=2179"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2012학년도 1학기 국가장학금 신청 안내<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2012년 대학생 등록금 부담 완화 방안으로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">기존 저소득층 장학금을 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">국가장학금 사업으로 통합</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하고, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">등록금 부담이</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 큰 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">저소득층에</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 대한 재정 지원을 강화하기 위하여 장학금 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">규모를</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 확대</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">하여 시행하오니 해당 학생들은 빠짐없이 국가장학금을 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012학년도 1학기부터 교내？외 장학금 지급시 국가장학금 신청결과(한국장학재단에서 제공된 소득분위)를 활용하여 지급할 예정이므로 해당자는 기간내 모두 신청(<font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>자세한 사항은&nbsp;첨부파일 참고</strong></font>)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. </font>신청 대상자 : 신입생 및 복학생(국가장학금 신청기간을 놓친 재학생도 추가신청 가능)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>* 국가장학금 미신청자는 스마일장학금 지급대상에서 제외됨</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. </font>신청기간 : 2012.3.2(금) ~ 2012.3.15(목)까지<!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. </font>신청방법 및 신청절차</span></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;① </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">한국장학재단</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">홈페이지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(</span><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">) 국가장학금 신청 바로가기 클릭</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">② <font color=\"#0000ff\">회원가입후</font> </span><strong><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">공인인증서로 로그인</span> </font></strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><!--StartFragment--></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;③ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">국가장학금 지원사업이란? 교육자료 이수(사업내용 및 지원대상 확인)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;④ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">국가장학금 메뉴선택</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">→신청하기</font>(신청정보 입력 및 신청동의서 및 서약서 동의)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;⑤ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">신청완료 및 제출서류 확인</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 국가장학금 신청 후 다음날 홈페이지에 방문하여&nbsp;&nbsp; 서류제출 여부 확인</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;⑥ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">서류 제출방법</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 수혜현황에서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">서류제출 대상자일 경우 필수서류 및 선택서류를 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청서에 첨부하여 온라인으로 서류업로드하거나 팩스로 제출</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -69.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 69.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;？ 한국장학재단 팩스(0507-789-8830, 0507-775-8830)로 신청서 출력하여 함께 송부</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -26.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 50.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;？</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 한국장학재단 [홈페이지(www.kosaf.go.kr)&gt;마이페이지&gt;서류업로드]에서 이미지파일 업로드</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 장학생 선발 심사</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -78.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 78.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 소득심사, 성적심사 및 직전학기 중복지원 요건을 충족한 자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -43pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 43pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대학의 등록금 납부금액 확정 전 대상자 선정</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;* 지급대상에서 제외되는 경우 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;？ 해당 학기를 등록하지 않고 휴학한 경우 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;？ 자퇴, 제적 등의 학적변동이 있는 경우 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -27.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 27.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;？ 학기 초과자, 대학원생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 24.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 장학생 확인 방법</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 35pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(Ⅰ유형) 학생은 개별적으로 한국장학재단 [홈페이지(www.kosaf.go.kr)&gt;마이페이지&gt;수혜현황]에서 확인 가능</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- (Ⅱ유형) 학생은 소속대학에서 장학생 선정 결과 및 지급금액을 확인</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 장학금 지급</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① (1차) 등록금고지서 학비감면(재학생 기준)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② (2차) 개별장학금 지급(신입생 및 편입·복학생 등)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\"><!--StartFragment--></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">7. 문의처</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 한국장학재단 상담센터 1666-5114</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 학생